to read, download or clone the Materials, and to copy, inspect, modify,
compile and run them in a private environment under your control, solely
for security review, verification and evaluation. You may publish your
findings, including critical findings, and limited source excerpts reasonably
necessary to explain them. No approval of your findings is required.

3. Rights not granted
Except as permitted by Sections 2, 4 and 5 or by separate written permission,
this license does not authorize publishing, distributing, selling,
sublicensing or externally hosting the Materials, modifications, derivative
works or compiled builds, or using them to provide products or services to
others. This includes free application redistribution and closed-source
commercial variants. Permission to evaluate a private build does not grant
an official application purchase entitlement or a production-use license.

4. GitHub platform rights
This license does not limit rights independently granted by the Licensor
to GitHub, its affiliates or other users under the applicable GitHub Terms
of Service, including ordinary viewing and forking of a public repository
through GitHub. This section grants no additional rights to redistribute
outside those platform grants, publish binaries or commercially exploit
derivatives beyond those grants or the other permissions in this license.

5. Third-party materials and statutory rights
Third-party materials remain subject to their own licenses. This license
does not restrict rights granted by those licenses, including rights in
vendored components, dependency code, generated runtime portions and
third-party artwork. Rights that applicable law does not permit to be
excluded or restricted remain unaffected. See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

6. Notices and branding
Copies made under this license must retain applicable copyright, license
and third-party notices. No right is granted to use Cardock, Maskden or
other branding to represent a product as official, supported or endorsed.

7. Reservation of rights and warranty
Rights not expressly granted are reserved. The review Materials are
provided "AS IS", without warranties to the extent permitted by applicable
